{"props":{"pageProps":{"listing":{"id":"0529eb8f-114f-426c-b8a2-151ee3a3accb","title":"AI × Solana Track Thailand Track $10,000","slug":"ai-solana-track","description":"\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuild What the Next Generation of Users Will Actually Use\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eAI is changing how software works. Agents can discover information, use applications, hold assets, make payments, and take action on behalf of users.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eSolana gives builders the infrastructure to make these experiences fast, programmable, and global.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSuperteam Thailand’s AI × Solana Track is for founders, developers, designers, product builders, AI builders, and teams who want to turn an idea into a working product during Colosseum.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eYou can start with AI. You can start with a user problem. You can start with an existing product.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eThe opportunity is to figure out where \u003cstrong\u003eAI + Solana creates something meaningfully better for the user, and build it.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWho Should Build?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eThis track is open to:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eAI builders and developers\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWeb3 and Solana builders\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWeb2 founders and product teams\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eDesigners and product managers\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eStudents and first-time hackathon builders\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eExisting startups exploring onchain products\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eTeams building consumer, financial, payments, commerce, social, or developer applications\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eYou do not need to have everything figured out before you start.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eBring the problem, the idea, the technical skill, the product insight, or the ambition. Find the right people and build together.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat Can You Build?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eExplore anything at the intersection of AI and Solana, including:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAI agents\u003c/strong\u003e that interact with users, applications, or other agents\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAgent wallets and payments\u003c/strong\u003e that allow software to hold and move assets\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAI-powered payments and commerce\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAI trading and financial applications\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConsumer AI applications\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWallet-based AI identity and permissions\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMCP tools and integrations\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAI-native developer infrastructure\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAutonomous services and coordination\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePayments for APIs, data, compute, and other resources\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNew products built around stablecoins, digital assets, or onchain ownership\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eThese are starting points, not boundaries.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStart with a real problem. Build something people want. Use AI and Solana where they create real leverage.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuild for Real Users\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eThe strongest products understand how their users actually live.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eFor consumer products, that could mean a mobile-first experience, social discovery, simple onboarding, fast transactions, and products designed around the platforms people already use.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eFor financial products, it could mean making complex actions dramatically simpler.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eFor businesses, it could mean automating payments, operations, data, or services.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eFor developers, it could mean making an entirely new class of applications easier to build.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuild for the user. Build for the device. Build for the distribution channel.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat You Get\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eSuperteam Thailand will support teams throughout the Colosseum journey with:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWorkshops\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/strong\u003ePractical sessions covering Solana, AI × Solana, product, distribution, pitching, and building for real users.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOffice Hours\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eGet direct feedback from developers, founders, product people, and ecosystem experts as you build.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuild Stations\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eWork alongside other builders, form teams, solve blockers, and ship together.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSubmission Support\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eGet feedback on your product, demo, pitch, documentation, and Colosseum submission before the deadline.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEcosystem Connections\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eConnect with founders, investors, protocols, infrastructure providers, and the wider Solana ecosystem.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDistribution \u0026amp; GTM Support\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eWork on your positioning, user acquisition, storytelling, and path from prototype to real users.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDemo Opportunities\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/strong\u003ePut your product in front of builders, founders, investors, ecosystem teams, and the Thailand tech community.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat Are We Looking For?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWe want to see products with:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReal User Value\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eA problem people actually care about and a product that makes the solution clear.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStrong Product Thinking\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eAn experience that is simple, intuitive, and designed around the target user.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMeaningful AI\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eAI should create genuine leverage within the product.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMeaningful Solana Integration\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eSolana should enable something important: payments, assets, identity, ownership, coordination, financial infrastructure, or another core product function.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStrong Distribution Thinking\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eA clear understanding of how the product will reach its first users and grow beyond the hackathon.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFounder Potential\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eA team with the speed, conviction, and ability to keep building after Colosseum.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA Product That Works\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/strong\u003eShow us what you built. A working demo is worth more than a great idea on paper.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eYour Submission\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eYour submission should make eight things clear:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Problem\u003c/strong\u003e — What are you solving?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe User\u003c/strong\u003e — Who is it for?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Product\u003c/strong\u003e — What did you build?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe AI\u003c/strong\u003e — How does AI create value?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Solana Layer\u003c/strong\u003e — What does Solana enable?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Distribution\u003c/strong\u003e — How will you reach users?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Future\u003c/strong\u003e — What could this become after the Colosseum?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Team\u003c/strong\u003e — Why are you the people to build it?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEligibility\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eTo participate in the Superteam Thailand AI × Solana Track:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eRegister for the official Colosseum Global Hackathon.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eSelect \u003cstrong\u003eThailand\u003c/strong\u003e as your country.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eMeet the official Colosseum eligibility requirements.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eSubmit your project through the official Colosseum platform.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eSubmit your project through \u003cstrong\u003eSuperteam Earn\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eBuild a working product that meaningfully incorporates Solana.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eFollow the official Colosseum rules and submission requirements.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStart Building\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eYou can be a Solana developer.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eYou can be an AI builder.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eYou can be a Web2 founder.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eYou can be a designer with a product idea.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eYou can be building your first startup.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIf you see a problem worth solving, bring it to Colosseum.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eSuperteam Thailand will help you find the people, knowledge, resources, feedback, and ecosystem connections to turn the idea into something real.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuild with Thailand. Build for the world.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eResources\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eSuperteam Thailand :\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://t.me/superteamthailand\"\u003e \u003c/a\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/superteam_TH\"\u003ehttps://linktr.ee/superteam_TH\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eSolana Documentation\u0026nbsp;\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://solana.com/docs\"\u003ehttps://solana.com/docs\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eColosseum Hackathon Platform\u0026nbsp; \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com/worldsfair\"\u003e\u003cu\u003ehttps://colosseum.com/worldsfair\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003ex402 Documentation\u0026nbsp;\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://solana.com/x402\"\u003ehttps://solana.com/x402\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSubmission Requirements\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTeams must:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eRegister for the global Colosseum hackathon.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eSubmit their project through the official Colosseum platform.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eMeet all official Colosseum hackathon rules and requirements.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eBuild a working product that meaningfully incorporates Solana.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eProvide a working demonstration of the product.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eProvide documentation covering the product, architecture, and key integrations.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eProvide access to the codebase where required for evaluation.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eYour submission should clearly communicate:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProblem\u003c/strong\u003e — What real problem are you solving?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUser\u003c/strong\u003e — Who is the product for?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct\u003c/strong\u003e — What have you built?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAI\u003c/strong\u003e — What role does AI play?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSolana\u003c/strong\u003e — Why is Solana important to the product?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDistribution\u003c/strong\u003e — How will you reach and retain users?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTraction / Potential\u003c/strong\u003e — What can this become after Colosseum?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTeam\u003c/strong\u003e — Why are you the team to build it?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTerms\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eParticipation in this track is voluntary and subject to the official Colosseum hackathon rules and terms.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eSubmissions will be evaluated based on the quality and completeness of the materials provided through the official Colosseum submission.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEligibility\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Project must be submitted to the Colosseum portal as well as on Superteam Earn.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eYour project must be eligible as per the \u003cem\u003eofficial rules of the global hackathon\u003c/em\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com/hackathon#faqs\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003ehttps://colosseum.com/hackathon#faqs\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eYou must register for the hackathon on the \u003cem\u003eColosseum platform\u003c/em\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com/worldsfair\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003ehttps://colosseum.com/worldsfair\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e and mark \"\u003cstrong\u003eThailand\u003c/strong\u003e\" as your country\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","deadline":"2026-10-13T06:59:00.000Z","commitmentDate":"2026-10-27T16:59:59.999Z","eligibility":[{"type":"text","order":1,"op